<title>UK: Lehman Brothers set warrants on German stocks.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers set warrants on German stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued 10 million European-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Deutsche Bank AG and Deutsche Telekom AG, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus said.  WARRANTS	 STRIKE  X-TRA LEVEL  ISS PRICE  REFERENCE</p>
<p> DEUTSCHE BANK  98.00   88.00	  7.25 DEM   95.30</p>
<p> DEUTSCHE TEL   36.00   32.00	  6.05 DEM   34.95</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	24.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT STG DDF	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
